How your own packages reach the ISO
===============================
live-build cannot download packages that aren't in Debian's archives.
So anything you build in packages/ (e.g. origin-desktop) must be
dropped here as a .deb before running lb build:

  cd ../../packages/origin-desktop
  dpkg-buildpackage -b -us -uc
  cp ../origin-desktop_*.deb ../../debian-live/config/packages/

live-build installs every .deb found in this directory into the image.
This directory itself is gitignored — .debs are build artifacts, not source.
